{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>The chiefs.</b> With a yod, like כבשים (lambs), for the princes are likened to sheep." "Now the Philistines, Edom, and Moab did not wage war against Israel in the wilderness." "<b>All the inhabitants of Canaan melted away.</b> On account of the reports, as is the way: ונשמע וימס לבבנו (Joshua 2:11). Also, the inhabitants of Canaan — the land of Canaan."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 15, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:34:45.623112160Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}